{"id":"7c724dbc1a48b779","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion.md","title":"ZFC Forcing8 Boolean Completion","display":"df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion — ZFC Forcing8 Boolean Completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion — ZFC Forcing8 Boolean Completion","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion — ZFC Forcing8 Boolean Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6995d561bb55c2ab\" href=\"?note=6995d561bb55c2ab\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b317b32e88081cdf\" href=\"?note=b317b32e88081cdf\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e28385785e6b2872\" href=\"?note=e28385785e6b2872\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md\">../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,B\\in V\">\\(P,B\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_B\\subseteq B^2\">\\(\\leq_B\\subseteq B^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6995d561bb55c2ab\" href=\"?note=6995d561bb55c2ab\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)\\)</span> exposes the Boolean operations and zero</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span> is the exact five-argument dense-embedding predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S(B,\\leq_B,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S\\!\\left(\ne,P,\\leq_P,B\\setminus\\{0_B\\},\n\\leq_B\\cap((B\\setminus\\{0_B\\})\\times(B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}))\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S(B,\\leq_B,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S\\!\\left(\ne,P,\\leq_P,B\\setminus\\{0_B\\},\n\\leq_B\\cap((B\\setminus\\{0_B\\})\\times(B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}))\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Boolean zero and operations are bound through the seven-place complete-algebra predicate, and the dense embedding receives both carriers and both orders. Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^+\">\\(B^+\\)</span> is no longer an unbound selector.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"6995d561bb55c2ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"b317b32e88081cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"e28385785e6b2872","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"6995d561bb55c2ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_B\\subseteq B^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S(B,\\leq_B,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S\\!\\left(\ne,P,\\leq_P,B\\setminus\\{0_B\\},\n\\leq_B\\cap((B\\setminus\\{0_B\\})\\times(B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}))\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B^+","display":false}],"bytes":1783,"backlinks":[{"id":"f04e4eaedaf78f0b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BooleanCompletion}_S$ (Boolean-completion predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion.md|58-df-zfc-forcing8-boolean-completion]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["6995d561bb55c2ab","b317b32e88081cdf","e28385785e6b2872"]}